  "historyNote": "#9343, eff 1-1-09; amd by #9817-A, eff 12-1-10; ss by #12342, eff 8-15-17; amd by #12949, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 12-20-19; ss by #13045, eff 6-2-20; ss by #13317, eff 12-22-21; ss by #14472, eff 1-19-26, EXPIRES: 1-19-36",
